    <div class="about-story-text">
      <h2>Wakabout</h2>
      <p>Wakabout was born out of a simple desire — to share the beauty, culture, and adventures that Nigeria and Africa
        have to offer with the world. What started as a personal travel journal in 2024 has grown into a full-fledged
        media platform connecting travelers, storytellers, and explorers.</p>
      <p>We believe that every destination has a story worth telling, and every journey has the power to change
        perspectives. Our team of passionate writers, photographers, and travel enthusiasts work tirelessly to bring you
        the best stories, guides, and recommendations from across the continent.</p>
      <p>Whether you're planning your first trip to Lagos or looking for a hidden waterfall in Plateau State, Wakabout
        is your trusted companion on the road.</p>
